OL,3,AAt least 20 killed after war-damaged
OL,4,AGaza building collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the Hamas-run Civil Defence
OL,7,Frescue service said they had initially
OL,8,Fbeen working with "empty hands" due to
OL,9,Ftight Israeli restrictions on equipment
OL,10,Fallowed into Gaza. However, they have
OL,11,Fsince been able to borrow some heavy
OL,12,Fmachinery from UN agencies and Egyptian
OL,13,Frelief workers.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
